WEBVTT

00:00:40.330 --> 00:00:42.160
Oka Hiromi, 15 years old.

00:00:42.160 --> 00:00:44.620
This spring, I have entered Nishi High...

00:00:44.620 --> 00:00:46.630
and became a member of the tennis team.

00:00:46.630 --> 00:00:48.870
In the rainy night I kick-off Goemon.

00:00:54.800 --> 00:00:56.750
Springtime of life,

00:00:54.800 --> 00:00:56.750
Seishyon,

00:00:56.970 --> 00:00:59.970
It's a dazzling season

00:00:56.970 --> 00:00:59.970
sore wa mabushii kisetsu

00:01:01.810 --> 00:01:03.480
Springtime of life,

00:01:01.810 --> 00:01:03.480
Seishyon,

00:01:03.480 --> 00:01:08.100
that's like free wings

00:01:03.480 --> 00:01:08.100
sore wa jiyuu na tsubasa

00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:11.480
youthfulness paired with shyness,

00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:11.480
