00:01:11.480 --> 00:01:17.190
yume wo motome te saa

00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:20.990
the beginning of the journey.

00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:20.990
tabidachi no toki

00:01:22.370 --> 00:01:28.340
Those days of youth

00:01:22.370 --> 00:01:28.340
Wakai hi wa

00:01:29.250 --> 00:01:35.920
the road is winding, as if a maze path

00:01:29.250 --> 00:01:35.920
mawarimichi, mayoi michi

00:01:35.920 --> 00:01:41.720
remember, my dear

00:01:35.920 --> 00:01:41.720
omoide shite, anata

00:01:42.560 --> 00:01:49.760
those days of yearning.

00:01:42.560 --> 00:01:49.760
ano hi no akogare wo

