Springtime of life,

00:01:50.480 --> 00:01:52.230
Seishyon,

00:01:52.230 --> 00:01:56.270
It's a dazzling season

00:01:52.230 --> 00:01:56.270
sore wa mubushii kisetsu

00:01:57.200 --> 00:01:59.160
Springtime of life,

00:01:57.200 --> 00:01:59.160
Seishyon,

00:01:59.160 --> 00:02:03.110
that's like free wings

00:01:59.160 --> 00:02:03.110
sore wa jiyuu na tsubasa

00:02:03.410 --> 00:02:06.790
youthfulness paired with shyness,

00:02:03.410 --> 00:02:06.790
wakasa ni hajirai

00:02:06.790 --> 00:02:12.880
seeking for one's dream

00:02:06.790 --> 00:02:12.880
yume wo motome te saa

00:02:12.880 --> 00:02:17.080
the beginning of the journey.

