tabidachi no toki

00:03:10.140 --> 00:03:12.440
Game. Five games to love.

00:03:12.440 --> 00:03:13.790
Lead Ryuuzaki.

00:03:18.570 --> 00:03:22.090
I'm going to miss it!
Ochoufujin's match is ending!

00:03:18.570 --> 00:03:22.090
"Ochoufujin" means "Madame Butterfly"

00:03:40.760 --> 00:03:45.100
Game set. End match won by Ryuuzaki.

00:03:45.100 --> 00:03:49.760
Scores, six games to one, six games to love.

00:03:45.950 --> 00:03:47.950
Spring Seasonal Match:
Minamisawa Academy VS Nishi High School

00:04:05.620 --> 00:04:06.430
Here goes!

00:04:12.500 --> 00:04:14.030
Nearly there!

00:04:21.170 --> 00:04:23.540
Sorry, are you all right?

00:04:28.060 --> 00:04:31.260
I'm really sorry, I was in hurry.

00:04:31.730 --> 00:04:32.750
This is yours, isn't it?

00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:37.020
Ah, yes. Thank you.

00:04:37.900 --> 00:04:39.520
Thank you very much.

00:04:41.030 --> 00:04:41.650
Ah!

00:04:41.650 --> 00:04:43.150
Excuse me!

00:04:45.410 --> 00:04:47.660
How is the match going?

00:04:47.660 --> 00:04:49.610
Is Nishi High winning?

00:04:49.610 --> 00:04:51.160
Straight wins for the Girls' team.

00:04:51.160 --> 00:04:53.110
Boys' match has already started.

00:04:53.110 --> 00:04:54.450
Thanks!

00:05:02.380 --> 00:05:05.880
Ah, just as I feared, I couldn't make it on time for Ochoufujin's match.

00:05:09.890 --> 00:05:12.760
Ochoufujin. Her real name is Ryuuzaki Reika.

00:05:14.060 --> 00:05:16.810
She holds the record for successive
victories in the regular games.

00:05:16.810 --> 00:05:18.520
No one has defeated her yet.

00:05:18.520 --> 00:05:21.100
She's a brilliant high school-level player.

00:05:24.610 --> 00:05:26.360
You are late, Hiromi.

00:05:26.860 --> 00:05:29.990
I'm sorry.

00:05:30.780 --> 00:05:34.710
This year, there are so many freshmen
joining the Nishi High's tennis team,

00:05:34.710 --> 00:05:37.320
all aspiring to be like Ochoufujin.

00:05:37.320 --> 00:05:41.330
Needless to say, I am one of those hopefuls.

00:05:48.720 --> 00:05:50.600
You woke up late!?

00:05:50.600 --> 00:05:52.050
That's right!

00:05:52.050 --> 00:05:54.640
The person you wanted to see
has just left.

00:05:54.640 --> 00:05:55.230
Ok.

00:05:55.230 --> 00:05:58.270
I met her just a moment ago,
and she spoke to me.

00:05:58.270 --> 00:06:00.060
Wow, what did she say?

00:06:00.060 --> 00:06:01.810
You are late, Hiromi.

00:06:02.650 --> 00:06:05.230
What? You've just got scolded!?

00:06:05.230 --> 00:06:06.980
But, it's okay.

00:06:09.160 --> 00:06:12.430
So far, the Boy's team seems
to be doing very well.

00:06:12.430 --> 00:06:13.620
The captain of the Boy's team,

00:06:13.620 --> 00:06:14.860
Ozaki-san.

00:06:15.750 --> 00:06:17.040
And the trump card...

00:06:17.040 --> 00:06:19.330
Toudou Takayuki-san.

00:06:19.960 --> 00:06:21.330
Wow!

00:06:30.140 --> 00:06:31.180
Hiromi, what are you doing after this?

00:06:31.180 --> 00:06:31.930
Are you going directly home?

00:06:31.930 --> 00:06:33.310
How about coming for some Ramen?

00:06:33.310 --> 00:06:35.600
Ah, Aikawa Maki-dono.

00:06:35.600 --> 00:06:37.560
Are you prepared for tomorrow's test?

00:06:37.560 --> 00:06:39.520
Ah! Test...!?

00:06:39.520 --> 00:06:40.940
The first English test...

00:06:40.940 --> 00:06:42.840
Oh, so it is...

00:06:42.840 --> 00:06:45.690
Well, it's Sunday today!

00:06:45.690 --> 00:06:46.610
Still early in the afternoon.

00:06:46.610 --> 00:06:48.070
It would be great to have
Ramen together!

00:06:48.070 --> 00:06:49.520
Sure, sure.

00:07:15.810 --> 00:07:17.930
Hiromi, did you do well in the test?

00:07:18.430 --> 00:07:21.180
Sure sure sure...

00:07:21.730 --> 00:07:22.480
How about you, Maki?

00:07:22.480 --> 00:07:24.130
Yes yes, almost...

00:07:24.130 --> 00:07:24.980
Two!

00:07:24.980 --> 00:07:25.980
One!

00:07:25.980 --> 00:07:27.110
Two!

00:07:27.110 --> 00:07:28.140
One!

00:07:38.580 --> 00:07:40.070
Back 50!

00:07:58.930 --> 00:08:01.340
Captain, he's coming.

00:08:05.610 --> 00:08:07.010
Finish practice!

00:08:07.010 --> 00:08:08.690
All members line up!

00:08:21.080 --> 00:08:23.580
As from today I will be your coach.

00:08:23.580 --> 00:08:24.910
I'm Munakata.

00:08:27.960 --> 00:08:29.790
First, run 20 laps around the ground.

00:08:30.010 --> 00:08:32.780
Eeeh!? Oh no! 20 laps!?

00:08:32.780 --> 00:08:34.460
Please wait, coach!

00:08:34.890 --> 00:08:38.430
Although the former coach
left the team last autumn,

00:08:38.430 --> 00:08:39.850
we still have been practicing,

00:08:39.850 --> 00:08:41.680
based on our own scheduled plan.

00:08:42.560 --> 00:08:43.770
From next week on, it's all right.

00:08:43.770 --> 00:08:45.940
This week we would like to continue
practicing in our own ways.

00:08:45.940 --> 00:08:48.770
Your practice schedule,

00:08:48.770 --> 00:08:50.560
I have checked it already.

00:08:50.560 --> 00:08:53.310
To me, it looks more like child's play.

00:08:53.990 --> 00:08:55.240
Start running!

00:08:55.240 --> 00:08:56.610
20 laps!

00:09:00.410 --> 00:09:01.200
Captain!

00:09:01.200 --> 00:09:02.110
Yes!?

00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:05.240
How many members are there in the Girls' team?

00:09:06.000 --> 00:09:06.980
Yes!

00:09:06.980 --> 00:09:08.830
In total, there are 128 members.

00:09:09.670 --> 00:09:12.080
There are 106 freshmen.

00:09:13.510 --> 00:09:16.420
22 seniors, including regular players.

00:09:20.220 --> 00:09:21.470
Still 5 more laps!

00:09:21.680 --> 00:09:23.180
All members raise your voices!

00:09:23.180 --> 00:09:24.750
Ye-s!

00:09:24.750 --> 00:09:28.430
Fight! Fight! Fight! Fight!

00:09:39.370 --> 00:09:41.160
What an arrogant man, he is!

00:09:41.160 --> 00:09:42.330
It's old-fashioned,

00:09:42.330 --> 00:09:43.790
to force others to follow his methods.

00:09:43.790 --> 00:09:44.910
That's rather behind times.

00:09:44.910 --> 00:09:46.540
Ah hurt! My knees are trembling still.

00:09:46.540 --> 00:09:47.910
Dammit!

00:09:48.460 --> 00:09:50.460
Hiromi, today, let's eat something nutritious.

00:09:50.460 --> 00:09:51.710
Ramen plus Gyoza.

00:09:50.460 --> 00:09:52.730
Gyoza: Japanese crescent shaped, pan-fried
dumplings stuff with minced pork & vegetables

00:09:51.710 --> 00:09:52.750
Let's!

00:09:54.300 --> 00:09:55.420
You know...

00:09:55.420 --> 00:09:57.630
He doesn't know anything about Nishi High.

00:09:57.630 --> 00:09:59.260
People call our school, the Kingdom of Tennis.

00:09:59.260 --> 00:10:00.390
That's a fact about Nishi High.

00:10:00.390 --> 00:10:01.210
Right!

00:10:01.210 --> 00:10:05.270
He even made our idol, Ochoufujin,

00:10:05.270 --> 00:10:07.100
ran with us 20 laps!

00:10:07.100 --> 00:10:09.180
Unacceptable!

00:10:12.400 --> 00:10:13.670
You know...

00:10:13.670 --> 00:10:16.030
Men with long legs, the skinny kind...

00:10:16.030 --> 00:10:17.520
I prefer those.

00:10:38.090 --> 00:10:39.010
Don't come close to me!

00:10:39.010 --> 00:10:40.800
Legs so short! You're kind of fat!

00:10:40.800 --> 00:10:42.090
Don't come close to me!

00:10:51.020 --> 00:10:53.770
One by one, step forward and say your name and grade.

00:10:53.980 --> 00:10:55.980
I will test your service and return abilities.

00:10:58.400 --> 00:10:59.980
Look Maki, over there.

00:11:00.570 --> 00:11:01.940
A video camera.

00:11:07.080 --> 00:11:08.030
Please.

00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:10.330
Throw the balls at high speed.

00:11:10.330 --> 00:11:11.490
About 20 balls for each person,

00:11:11.490 --> 00:11:12.710
beyond that if you like.

00:11:12.710 --> 00:11:15.160
You can choose the course of the balls.

00:11:15.160 --> 00:11:16.290
Yes!

00:11:22.390 --> 00:11:23.180
Let's start!

00:11:23.180 --> 00:11:24.590
Don't waste your time!

00:11:25.970 --> 00:11:27.720
They better not be wasting their time.

00:11:28.930 --> 00:11:30.800
Second grade, Tashima Emi!

00:11:40.360 --> 00:11:42.150
First grade, Kitashima Kazue!

00:11:48.660 --> 00:11:50.910
First grade, Mimura Keiko!

00:12:08.060 --> 00:12:09.840
Throw more speedy balls!

00:12:13.400 --> 00:12:14.890
Hurt!

00:12:24.990 --> 00:12:27.530
Aikawa Maki, First grade!

00:12:37.090 --> 00:12:38.710
Oka Hiromi, 15 years old!

00:12:38.710 --> 00:12:41.330
Ah-ah, no! First grade!

00:13:05.360 --> 00:13:06.570
Uh-oh!

00:13:18.250 --> 00:13:19.870
Yeah, enter.

00:13:21.090 --> 00:13:22.540
Here are the videotapes.

00:13:22.800 --> 00:13:24.080
Ah, thanks.

00:13:24.080 --> 00:13:25.300
Leave it there.

00:13:25.300 --> 00:13:27.710
I will pay for the tapes tomorrow.

00:13:28.930 --> 00:13:30.460
There's no need.

00:13:30.460 --> 00:13:34.090
The High School's representatives have plenty of tapes to spare.

00:13:34.850 --> 00:13:36.550
Well then, excuse me.

00:13:39.310 --> 00:13:40.940
Yeah! Here we have...

00:13:40.940 --> 00:13:42.360
The High School's chief and famous anchor man,

00:13:42.360 --> 00:13:43.030
Shibauji!

00:13:43.030 --> 00:13:44.360
Thanks for your co-operation in filming.

00:13:44.360 --> 00:13:45.450
You are welcome!

00:13:45.450 --> 00:13:47.160
Toudou, and Ozaki, the big two!

00:13:47.160 --> 00:13:48.950
You also did well with the machine operating.

00:13:48.950 --> 00:13:52.070
Besides that, tell me the truth.

00:13:52.790 --> 00:13:54.120
What is going on, really?

00:13:54.120 --> 00:13:55.290
If it was a for match, that's fine.

00:13:55.290 --> 00:13:57.460
But he only wanted to record the practice.

00:13:57.460 --> 00:13:58.560
I don't know.

00:13:58.560 --> 00:14:00.830
That's what we want to know as well!

00:14:01.300 --> 00:14:03.170
We were told to go to the girls' tennis-ground.

00:14:03.170 --> 00:14:05.420
That's when we realized you were there also.

00:14:06.300 --> 00:14:07.590
He doesn't talk a lot.

00:14:07.590 --> 00:14:09.050
Only the tennis machine instructions.

00:14:09.050 --> 00:14:09.860
That's all.

00:14:09.860 --> 00:14:12.510
Same, he turned up at the Resource room.

00:14:12.510 --> 00:14:14.470
I will borrow a video camera.

00:14:14.470 --> 00:14:15.930
Just those words.

00:14:16.440 --> 00:14:17.890
Munakata coach...{wasn't it Munakata?}

00:14:17.890 --> 00:14:19.260
Who is he?

00:14:19.260 --> 00:14:21.020
He is a coach dispatched from the Federation.

00:14:21.020 --> 00:14:22.670
That's for sure, but...

00:14:22.670 --> 00:14:24.270
I will check for more details.

00:14:30.370 --> 00:14:32.530
Yes, this is Oka.

00:14:32.870 --> 00:14:34.990
Yes, just a minute please.

00:14:39.000 --> 00:14:40.450
Hiromi...?!

00:14:41.290 --> 00:14:43.710
Telephone! From Maki-chan!

00:14:44.300 --> 00:14:46.790
Yes, yes, yes, yes!

00:14:47.170 --> 00:14:48.840
Yes, what's up, Maki-chan?

00:14:48.840 --> 00:14:50.010
What's going on?

00:14:51.180 --> 00:14:52.750
Just took a bath.

00:14:52.750 --> 00:14:54.140
I'm brushing my hair row.

00:14:54.140 --> 00:14:55.370
How about you, Maki?

00:14:55.370 --> 00:14:57.100
Oh wow, you're polishing your nails?

00:14:57.100 --> 00:14:57.940
You working hard?

00:14:57.940 --> 00:14:59.420
Good work, good work!

00:14:59.420 --> 00:15:00.640
So, what's up?

00:15:00.640 --> 00:15:02.110
I can't sleep!

00:15:02.110 --> 00:15:03.190
I need you to listen to me.

00:15:03.190 --> 00:15:05.140
I feel rather nervous.

00:15:05.400 --> 00:15:06.740
This will be a long story, then.

00:15:06.740 --> 00:15:08.270
I'll put it through my room.

00:15:14.330 --> 00:15:15.700
I'm ready, okay?

00:15:15.700 --> 00:15:16.810
Can I start?

00:15:16.810 --> 00:15:17.620
Go ahead.

00:15:17.620 --> 00:15:20.080
What does that novice coach want?!

00:15:20.080 --> 00:15:21.460
That practice we had today?!

00:15:21.460 --> 00:15:23.920
It's as if he's testing each one of us.

00:15:23.920 --> 00:15:25.420
I don't want tests other
than in school subjects!

00:15:25.420 --> 00:15:28.010
I never imagined we would be
tested for playing club tennis!

00:15:28.010 --> 00:15:28.670
I can't accept it!

00:15:28.670 --> 00:15:30.050
Even if he has long legs!

00:15:30.050 --> 00:15:30.880
I can't accept it!

00:15:30.880 --> 00:15:32.470
If I have to suffer...

00:15:32.470 --> 00:15:34.390
I will quit from the tennis team!

00:15:34.390 --> 00:15:35.800
I will quit...!

00:15:37.890 --> 00:15:39.770
Jin, long time no see!

00:15:39.770 --> 00:15:41.100
How have you been?

00:15:41.690 --> 00:15:42.480
Ranko...

00:15:42.480 --> 00:15:43.270
Welcome.

00:15:43.270 --> 00:15:44.500
Come in.

00:15:44.500 --> 00:15:45.690
You surprised me...

00:15:45.690 --> 00:15:48.060
By accepting to coach
the Nishi tennis team.

00:15:49.700 --> 00:15:51.280
Are you interested in Ryuuzaki Reika?

00:15:51.280 --> 00:15:53.230
Or Toudou Takayuki?

00:15:54.740 --> 00:15:56.650
They are Nishi members, right?

00:16:06.610 --> 00:16:09.960
You're not going to be my coach?

00:16:14.890 --> 00:16:16.380
It's okay, Jin.

00:16:16.600 --> 00:16:20.430
Though, I'm glad to see that
you're back in the tennis courts.

00:16:26.230 --> 00:16:28.060
Well then, I must get going.

00:16:29.230 --> 00:16:31.560
Did you have something to talk with me?

00:16:34.780 --> 00:16:36.780
I just came to see you.

00:16:38.160 --> 00:16:39.150
See you.

00:16:40.500 --> 00:16:41.820
Take care.

00:17:17.200 --> 00:17:18.870
Well, I like playing tennis,

00:17:18.870 --> 00:17:20.290
and I will practice very hard.

00:17:20.290 --> 00:17:22.330
But just as a club activity...

00:17:22.330 --> 00:17:24.000
I don't mean to become a professional.

00:17:24.000 --> 00:17:25.080
I only want to take it easy.

00:17:25.080 --> 00:17:26.700
I'm not saying that I will quit.

00:17:26.700 --> 00:17:28.790
I mean, I do have resentments.

00:17:28.790 --> 00:17:30.630
That coach did make us all uncomfortable.

00:17:30.630 --> 00:17:32.970
Club activities are supposed to be relaxing,

00:17:32.970 --> 00:17:34.580
compared to classes!

00:17:35.130 --> 00:17:37.800
Ah, you gathered all that
from yesterday's practice?

00:17:37.800 --> 00:17:39.560
Maki, you're so {sensai (=delicate)}delicate!

00:17:39.560 --> 00:17:41.310
Yes, like Kantou-dai Shinsai earthquake!{Yes, that's true Kantou-dai Shinsai!}{pun, Kantou-dai Shinsai - big historical earthquake in japan}

00:17:41.310 --> 00:17:43.720
I'm a living species of the delicate order.

00:17:47.270 --> 00:17:48.150
Fight! Fight! Fight!

00:17:48.150 --> 00:17:48.980
What now?!
Fight! Fight! Fight!

00:17:48.980 --> 00:17:49.560
Fight! Fight! Fight!

00:18:01.370 --> 00:18:03.110
Everybody, listen to me!

00:18:03.910 --> 00:18:06.530
The Kantou District Tournament is next week.

00:18:07.120 --> 00:18:10.200
From now on, I'm going to nominate five of you as regular players.

00:18:13.510 --> 00:18:15.580
3rd grade, Ryuuzaki Reika.

00:18:15.800 --> 00:18:16.670
Yes!

00:18:16.930 --> 00:18:18.840
Same 3rd grade, Tagi Michiru.

00:18:19.680 --> 00:18:20.510
Yes!

00:18:21.310 --> 00:18:22.760
Ikeda Kazuko... 3rd grade.

00:18:22.760 --> 00:18:23.720
Yes!

00:18:24.560 --> 00:18:26.510
2nd grade, Hagi Machiko.

00:18:26.810 --> 00:18:27.600
Yes!

00:18:27.900 --> 00:18:29.770
And Oka Hiromi, 1st grade.

00:18:29.770 --> 00:18:30.970
That is all.

00:18:35.240 --> 00:18:37.730
Oka, are you paying attention?

00:18:39.030 --> 00:18:39.980
Yes!

00:18:42.080 --> 00:18:42.990
All nominated players,

00:18:42.990 --> 00:18:44.690
come to my office immediately.

00:18:44.690 --> 00:18:46.530
I will list your training schedule.

00:18:47.710 --> 00:18:48.700
Otowa Kyouko?

00:18:48.700 --> 00:18:49.580
Yes, she is.

00:18:49.790 --> 00:18:53.000
You should not have chosen Oka-san
over Otowa Kyouko-san.

00:18:56.920 --> 00:18:57.840
Last autumn,

00:18:57.840 --> 00:18:59.680
when we won the National Championship.

00:18:59.680 --> 00:19:01.420
Otowa-san was a regular player then.

00:19:04.470 --> 00:19:05.350
Oka-san...

00:19:05.350 --> 00:19:07.100
has barely learned enough of the main techniques.

00:19:07.100 --> 00:19:08.970
And only recently joined our members.

00:19:08.970 --> 00:19:10.400
Not to be impudent, Ryuuzaki...

00:19:10.400 --> 00:19:12.520
It's up to me to choose the regulars.

00:19:18.570 --> 00:19:19.490
That's terrible!

00:19:19.490 --> 00:19:21.110
What on earth?

00:19:21.110 --> 00:19:22.950
Otowa-san, poor her!

00:19:22.950 --> 00:19:23.940
I think so, too!

00:19:24.990 --> 00:19:26.330
Oka-san and that coach,

00:19:26.330 --> 00:19:28.660
do they have something special?

00:19:28.660 --> 00:19:29.370
Never!

00:19:29.370 --> 00:19:31.280
It's not right!

00:19:45.890 --> 00:19:47.930
Well...

00:19:49.850 --> 00:19:50.970
Well...

00:19:51.190 --> 00:19:53.890
Can you go with me, Aikawa Maki?

00:20:08.330 --> 00:20:11.160
I've come to correct a misunderstanding.

00:20:12.290 --> 00:20:15.250
You don't know much about our Nishi Tennis team, yet.

00:20:15.250 --> 00:20:16.130
I suppose...

00:20:16.130 --> 00:20:18.920
If I play as a representative player in the match,

00:20:18.920 --> 00:20:19.590
perhaps...

00:20:19.590 --> 00:20:20.510
No, I'm sure that...

00:20:20.510 --> 00:20:24.090
I will hurt Nishi's great pride as
the symbol of the tennis kingdom.

00:20:24.300 --> 00:20:25.930
As Ryuuzaki-senpai says,

00:20:25.930 --> 00:20:28.140
Otowa Kyouko-san should be the regular.

00:20:28.140 --> 00:20:29.160
That's all!

00:20:29.160 --> 00:20:29.980
Is that all right?

00:20:29.980 --> 00:20:31.230
I haven't left out anything?

00:20:31.230 --> 00:20:32.520
No, you did very well.

00:20:32.520 --> 00:20:34.720
You've told him everything you wanted to say.

00:20:34.720 --> 00:20:36.230
Please allow me to withdraw.

00:20:36.230 --> 00:20:38.390
Excuse me!

00:20:39.860 --> 00:20:41.560
My decision is final.

00:20:43.530 --> 00:20:45.160
You'll have a match in one week.

00:20:45.160 --> 00:20:47.530
Until then, you got a lot of preparing to do.

00:20:51.000 --> 00:20:53.030
Don't waste your time.

00:21:08.310 --> 00:21:09.720
Welcome home.

00:21:11.640 --> 00:21:13.020
What's wrong, Reika?

00:21:13.020 --> 00:21:14.680
Why don't you take off your coat?

00:21:15.190 --> 00:21:17.930
May I ask you something, Father?

00:21:17.930 --> 00:21:19.440
All right, go on.

00:21:19.440 --> 00:21:22.630
Who is he, that Mr. Munakata?

00:21:22.630 --> 00:21:23.900
Pardon?

00:21:24.400 --> 00:21:26.870
I thought, you must have recommended him...

00:21:26.870 --> 00:21:29.440
as Nishi Highs' tennis coach.

00:21:29.440 --> 00:21:30.580
That's right.

00:21:30.580 --> 00:21:32.820
What's wrong with Mr. Munakata?

00:21:33.080 --> 00:21:35.530
I just wanted to ask you who he is.

00:21:36.830 --> 00:21:38.380
He's an excellent coach.

00:21:38.380 --> 00:21:40.090
As the Director of the Tennis Union,

00:21:40.090 --> 00:21:41.370
I can guarantee that.

00:21:41.760 --> 00:21:43.420
Is that not enough to be a coach?

00:21:45.430 --> 00:21:46.220
Reika,

00:21:46.220 --> 00:21:51.590
as a first grade player,shouldn't you
trust your coach regardless?

00:21:52.140 --> 00:21:55.010
Same as I trust you...

00:22:16.420 --> 00:22:17.410
Now!

00:22:21.460 --> 00:22:22.370
Hiromi?

00:22:22.800 --> 00:22:24.420
Hiromi can you hear me?

00:23:04.050 --> 00:23:04.840
Hiromi,

00:23:04.840 --> 00:23:05.960
Hiromi?

00:23:07.590 --> 00:23:09.970
Don't sleep around here...

00:23:09.970 --> 00:23:11.760
Now change your clothes and go home.

00:23:11.760 --> 00:23:13.590
Right, right?

00:23:22.900 --> 00:23:24.520
Everyone is talking.

00:23:24.730 --> 00:23:26.490
Even now that the match is coming close.

00:23:26.490 --> 00:23:27.610
Just one player.

00:23:27.610 --> 00:23:31.070
Besides, she's just a fresh member
that you're spending all your time on.

00:23:31.070 --> 00:23:32.280
That's unfair!

00:23:33.580 --> 00:23:34.570
Go home.

00:23:34.910 --> 00:23:36.780
The main gate will be closed.

00:23:39.500 --> 00:23:41.420
Coach, please tell me why?!

00:23:41.420 --> 00:23:44.330
What part is Oka-san better than me?!

00:23:46.550 --> 00:23:48.290
Munakata coach!!

00:23:52.340 --> 00:23:53.930
Stop, don't be like that, Otowa-san.

00:23:53.930 --> 00:23:55.010
If you are my friend,

00:23:55.010 --> 00:23:57.800
don't behave in such a way that hurts your pride.

00:24:41.520 --> 00:24:43.810
Hiromi, what are you thinking of?

00:24:44.020 --> 00:24:45.650
Nothing special.

00:24:45.650 --> 00:24:46.890
Really?

00:24:47.980 --> 00:24:50.060
You got three days left before the match.

00:24:50.440 --> 00:24:54.070
It is certain that you'll be rejected as a
regular player at that time, more forcibly.

00:24:54.570 --> 00:24:56.030
I can't bear watching you...

00:24:56.030 --> 00:24:56.780
Everyday, everyday,

00:24:56.780 --> 00:24:58.740
you're put into hard training, and all exhausted.

00:24:58.740 --> 00:24:59.490
I'm all right.

00:24:59.490 --> 00:25:00.200
What?

00:25:00.200 --> 00:25:02.570
I'm exhausted, but it's all right.

00:25:03.290 --> 00:25:05.830
To my surprise Hiromi seems all right.

00:25:17.800 --> 00:25:18.970
Excuse me!

00:25:20.470 --> 00:25:22.770
You're the player who got selected as a regular...

00:25:22.770 --> 00:25:25.220
Oka Hiromi-kun, right?

00:25:26.690 --> 00:25:28.930
Do your best in the match.

00:25:30.730 --> 00:25:32.600
Yes, I will do my best!

00:25:35.410 --> 00:25:38.360
Nothing, but that Munakata coach
has made a drastic decision...

00:25:38.360 --> 00:25:41.780
I heard that she's literally a beginner...

00:25:41.780 --> 00:25:43.710
Wait, wait, now you're getting more interested...

00:25:43.710 --> 00:25:45.250
in that enigmatic person, Munakata Jin!

00:25:45.250 --> 00:25:46.540
You must be full of curiosity{curiosities},

00:25:46.540 --> 00:25:48.120
as the head of the press department!

00:25:48.710 --> 00:25:49.880
Apart from that,

00:25:49.880 --> 00:25:52.920
the gaze you gave Oka Hiromi just now...

00:25:52.920 --> 00:25:54.720
That attracted my interests more.

00:25:54.720 --> 00:25:56.250
Have a heart!

00:25:56.250 --> 00:25:57.260
Do I?

00:25:57.260 --> 00:25:58.260
Yes, you do.

00:25:58.260 --> 00:26:00.470
Wait, wait, I also have a right!

00:26:02.100 --> 00:26:03.220
Go!

00:26:07.810 --> 00:26:10.350
Ryuuzaki, play against Oka!

00:26:10.820 --> 00:26:13.480
Oka, take your racket and enter the court!

00:26:18.070 --> 00:26:19.070
Yes!

00:26:23.330 --> 00:26:24.780
I'm grateful to you!

00:26:58.570 --> 00:26:59.740
What was that?

00:26:59.740 --> 00:27:02.280
Ochoufujin was being kind playing against her.

00:27:02.280 --> 00:27:04.080
She couldn't even return one ball!

00:27:04.080 --> 00:27:05.580
I can't believe she is a regular player!

00:27:05.580 --> 00:27:06.530
It's impossible!

00:27:07.080 --> 00:27:09.450
What will become of our tennis kingdom?

00:27:10.130 --> 00:27:12.290
I didn't become a regular player because I wanted!

00:27:12.920 --> 00:27:15.370
But because you, Munakata, wanted!

00:27:19.970 --> 00:27:20.920
All right!

00:27:21.300 --> 00:27:23.600
That things have come to this much debated match,

00:27:23.600 --> 00:27:25.840
I will decorate my debut with a great victory.

00:27:37.610 --> 00:27:41.020
Best of three set match, service Oka!

00:27:41.740 --> 00:27:43.150
Calm down!

00:27:48.410 --> 00:27:49.530
Fault!

00:27:56.300 --> 00:27:57.460
Double fault!

00:27:57.460 --> 00:27:59.000
Love fifteen!

00:28:17.570 --> 00:28:19.270
Love thirty!

00:28:27.740 --> 00:28:29.140
Hiromi!

00:28:29.140 --> 00:28:30.700
Telephone!

00:28:31.250 --> 00:28:32.500
Yes, yes!

00:28:32.500 --> 00:28:34.540
From Munakata-san.

00:28:40.470 --> 00:28:44.050
I'm giving you just one word of
advice for tomorrow's match...

00:28:44.340 --> 00:28:46.420
Tennis Rule, Article 32...

00:28:46.420 --> 00:28:47.100
During the games,

00:28:47.100 --> 00:28:49.840
the players should not receive any
kind of instruction nor advice.

00:28:49.840 --> 00:28:52.000
This is the essence of tennis play.

00:28:52.000 --> 00:28:52.900
You should hit the ball,

00:28:52.900 --> 00:28:55.680
run and think by yourself alone.

00:29:54.920 --> 00:29:56.870
I lost my game due to a twitch...

00:29:56.870 --> 00:29:59.750
As my debut match, that's quite spectacular.

00:30:00.250 --> 00:30:03.580
But now everything should be obvious.

00:30:04.550 --> 00:30:06.720
Even that coach who pushed the matter ahead,

00:30:06.720 --> 00:30:07.430
by force.

00:30:07.430 --> 00:30:10.590
He doesn't have any reason to set
me in a regular position now...

00:30:11.520 --> 00:30:13.430
You're right...

00:30:15.270 --> 00:30:16.560
For Munakata coach,

00:30:16.560 --> 00:30:19.220
it should be obvious on that topic.

00:30:19.770 --> 00:30:21.190
I see...

00:30:21.190 --> 00:30:23.020
You see...

00:30:40.210 --> 00:30:41.380
If you lose points,

00:30:41.380 --> 00:30:43.710
or lose your match, no way.

00:30:43.710 --> 00:30:45.630
But dropping out of the game because of a twitch,

00:30:45.630 --> 00:30:47.220
that's the worst way to lose as a player.

00:30:47.220 --> 00:30:49.090
Physical strength is part of the real ability.

00:30:49.090 --> 00:30:51.430
I repeat, I don't have any real ability.

00:30:51.430 --> 00:30:52.390
Absolutely certain that I don't have it.

00:30:52.390 --> 00:30:54.560
So please, set Otowa-san back as a regular.

00:30:54.560 --> 00:30:57.190
I did my best by my own effort...

00:30:57.190 --> 00:30:58.470
You did your best?

00:30:58.690 --> 00:31:00.720
I do not think so.

00:31:01.150 --> 00:31:03.480
From tomorrow morning, for a month,
you'll run five kilometres before you come to school.

00:31:03.480 --> 00:31:06.280
If you can do that, then I will
recognize that you're doing your best.

00:31:06.280 --> 00:31:07.980
That can't be, coach.

00:31:24.630 --> 00:31:26.210
I'm really mad!

00:31:31.140 --> 00:31:33.260
Jin, are you awake?

00:31:34.060 --> 00:31:35.460
I'm just on my way to school,
but I have some time,

00:31:35.460 --> 00:31:37.180
so I decided to stop by.

00:31:37.180 --> 00:31:38.680
Ranko...

00:31:39.060 --> 00:31:40.760
I'm awake.

00:31:40.760 --> 00:31:43.270
I want to hear about the match the other day.

00:31:43.980 --> 00:31:46.400
The player who lost the game by twitching,

00:31:46.400 --> 00:31:48.940
is that the player you're looking for?

00:31:49.700 --> 00:31:52.930
I'm not sure that she will
become a real treasure.

00:31:52.930 --> 00:31:54.830
No, she has a good spring in her body.

00:31:54.830 --> 00:31:57.740
That's what you would expect of Jin, good choice!

00:32:02.540 --> 00:32:05.330
You go to the hospital frequently, don't you?

00:32:17.640 --> 00:32:19.020
Arms closer to your body!

00:32:19.020 --> 00:32:20.680
Draw the balls closer to your body!

00:32:23.810 --> 00:32:25.520
Step towards the ball!

00:32:33.990 --> 00:32:35.280
Ten more times!

00:32:56.310 --> 00:32:58.470
Hiromi, Hiromi!

00:32:58.720 --> 00:33:02.390
Where are you going all of a sudden?

00:33:02.390 --> 00:33:03.350
Sorry Maki,

00:33:03.350 --> 00:33:05.470
Coach called for me, for some reason...

00:33:06.320 --> 00:33:07.930
I understand...

00:33:19.200 --> 00:33:21.740
You're also called for by Munakata coach?

00:33:22.160 --> 00:33:23.160
Y-yes.

00:33:24.960 --> 00:33:25.830
Toudou,

00:33:25.830 --> 00:33:28.460
Ozaki and Ochoufujin were also called for.

00:33:28.460 --> 00:33:29.460
Really?

00:33:29.760 --> 00:33:31.790
Something will happen, to us.

00:33:36.300 --> 00:33:37.380
Come in!

00:33:41.270 --> 00:33:42.310
Well, I'm...

00:33:42.310 --> 00:33:43.970
Sit down, Ryuuzaki.

00:33:48.610 --> 00:33:52.350
Oka, we finished discussing just before you entered.

00:33:52.350 --> 00:33:54.480
So, I will give you a briefing of it.

00:33:54.860 --> 00:33:55.570
In one month's time,

00:33:55.570 --> 00:33:57.820
the Union and prefecture's TV will organize

00:33:57.820 --> 00:34:00.070
junior selection match to take place.

00:34:00.070 --> 00:34:00.950
This is just a regular one,

00:34:00.950 --> 00:34:03.110
for prefecture players and double match only.

00:34:03.620 --> 00:34:04.330
From Nishi High,

00:34:04.330 --> 00:34:06.860
we will select a team each of girls and boys.

00:34:06.860 --> 00:34:09.040
The boy's team, Toudou and Ozaki...

00:34:09.040 --> 00:34:11.130
and the girls team Ryuuzaki and Oka,

00:34:11.130 --> 00:34:12.040
it's you...

00:34:14.380 --> 00:34:16.540
But, it's not decided yet, Oka-san.

00:34:17.090 --> 00:34:18.260
Sometime ago, I,

00:34:18.260 --> 00:34:21.100
decided not to participate in that match.

00:34:21.100 --> 00:34:22.010
Ryuuzaki!

00:34:22.220 --> 00:34:24.140
Are you insisting that you won't play with Oka?

00:34:24.140 --> 00:34:25.440
Stop talking about that.

00:34:25.440 --> 00:34:28.010
Do you want me to say the reason again?

00:34:28.010 --> 00:34:29.310
In front of Oka-san?

00:34:34.110 --> 00:34:36.190
Coach, it's impossible.

00:34:36.990 --> 00:34:39.620
It's impossible for me to double with Ochoufujin.

00:34:39.620 --> 00:34:41.540
There's so much difference in our abilities.

00:34:41.540 --> 00:34:43.290
It's natural that Ochoufujin,

00:34:43.290 --> 00:34:45.780
no - Ryuuzaki-senpai is vexed about this.

00:34:45.780 --> 00:34:46.750
Oka,

00:34:46.750 --> 00:34:49.000
you should double with Ryuuzaki in the match.

00:34:49.000 --> 00:34:50.950
You should think only of that!

00:35:01.350 --> 00:35:03.100
Ochoufujin didn't come to practice today, either.

00:35:03.100 --> 00:35:04.640
What happened to her?

00:35:04.640 --> 00:35:06.600
Did you know,

00:35:07.730 --> 00:35:10.520
she reported that she'd caught a cold?

00:35:19.620 --> 00:35:21.740
To the esteemed Ryuuzaki-sama,

00:35:22.620 --> 00:35:23.320
I...

00:35:25.040 --> 00:35:25.910
I was yearning for you,

00:35:25.910 --> 00:35:26.790
I was just simply yearning for you.

00:35:26.790 --> 00:35:28.450
I was just simply yearning for you.

00:35:29.040 --> 00:35:30.450
See, you, bye!

00:35:34.420 --> 00:35:35.870
Simply, well,

00:35:36.420 --> 00:35:39.110
Yearning for you and joining the tennis team.

00:35:39.110 --> 00:35:42.040
I know it's untrue that you'd caught a cold.

00:35:42.040 --> 00:35:43.380
I understand...

00:35:44.470 --> 00:35:45.420
But...

00:35:45.420 --> 00:35:47.270
But I accepted it...

00:35:47.270 --> 00:35:49.100
I will send you these flowers in sympathy.

00:35:49.100 --> 00:35:51.180
Come back soon to the tennis court, please.

00:35:51.730 --> 00:35:53.150
About that double match,

00:35:53.150 --> 00:35:55.280
I will tell the coach,

00:35:55.280 --> 00:35:57.900
that I definitely can not play.

00:35:58.110 --> 00:35:59.480
H. O.

00:36:01.160 --> 00:36:02.320
Yes!

00:36:08.500 --> 00:36:10.210
That will not do.

00:36:10.210 --> 00:36:11.670
It's not even classy,

00:36:11.670 --> 00:36:13.950
it'll only ruin it further.

00:36:30.640 --> 00:36:31.720
Reika,

00:36:33.110 --> 00:36:35.770
We have a guest, come inside.

00:36:40.320 --> 00:36:42.860
I understand how Oka-san feels now...

00:36:42.860 --> 00:36:44.450
She must've been confused,

00:36:44.450 --> 00:36:46.120
about coach's forcible ways.

00:36:46.120 --> 00:36:48.250
You are being rude to our guest.

00:36:48.250 --> 00:36:49.870
Sit down and let's have a talk.

00:36:49.870 --> 00:36:51.120
I...

00:36:51.540 --> 00:36:54.000
I've been making a record of successive victories,

00:36:54.000 --> 00:36:56.040
not only in the single games but also in the doubles.

00:36:56.040 --> 00:36:57.090
That's because,

00:36:57.090 --> 00:36:59.570
I'd. selected my partner, myself.

00:36:59.570 --> 00:37:01.470
To form a combination of doubles,

00:37:01.470 --> 00:37:04.130
it's necessary to be chosen by each other.

00:37:04.130 --> 00:37:06.340
Reika, take a seat.

00:37:06.640 --> 00:37:07.670
Yes...

00:37:10.430 --> 00:37:13.180
Coach, I can't understand it.

00:37:13.180 --> 00:37:15.730
You can't be satisfied with a freshman as regular,

00:37:15.730 --> 00:37:18.110
you want me double with her as well.

00:37:18.110 --> 00:37:19.230
It's no use.

00:37:19.230 --> 00:37:20.990
I can't accept your proposal, at all.

00:37:20.990 --> 00:37:22.860
Don't misunderstand. Ryuuzaki,

00:37:22.860 --> 00:37:26.690
I didn't come here to persuade you.

00:37:31.500 --> 00:37:32.160
Reika,

00:37:32.160 --> 00:37:35.410
I will leave matters concerning
you to, Mr. Munakata.

00:37:57.900 --> 00:38:03.480
Oka-san, all of my previous
partners can return such balls.

00:38:13.460 --> 00:38:15.870
Hurry, back to the base line.

00:38:15.870 --> 00:38:17.120
Yes!

00:38:44.530 --> 00:38:46.900
Fore, Backhand, Volley...

00:38:46.900 --> 00:38:49.570
You can't seem to do anything satisfactorily.

00:38:53.290 --> 00:38:55.290
Even if you are my partner,

00:38:55.290 --> 00:38:57.740
you can't be accepted, totally.

00:39:06.180 --> 00:39:09.050
Then the God of Thunder said...

00:39:09.050 --> 00:39:12.700
Why are you hiding not your navel but your head?

00:39:12.700 --> 00:39:15.720
Intrepidly, the little boy answered.

00:39:15.720 --> 00:39:19.150
I have eyes, nose and mouth on my head...

00:39:19.150 --> 00:39:20.020
With my eyes,

00:39:20.020 --> 00:39:21.650
I can find my mother's white hair.

00:39:21.650 --> 00:39:22.480
With my nose,

00:39:22.480 --> 00:39:24.690
I can smell my mother's scent.

00:39:24.900 --> 00:39:27.230
And with my mouth,

00:39:27.490 --> 00:39:29.690
I can sing a song...

00:39:30.450 --> 00:39:33.400
I can sing a song for my mother.

00:39:35.790 --> 00:39:37.750
Impressed, the god of thunder became moved,

00:39:37.750 --> 00:39:40.790
due to the loving feelings of
that little boy towards his mother.

00:39:42.420 --> 00:39:43.860
It's cruel!

00:39:43.860 --> 00:39:47.290
For Ochoufujin, to say such a harsh thing...

00:39:47.290 --> 00:39:49.420
to poor Hiromi!

00:40:26.800 --> 00:40:28.580
Morning, Oka-kun.

00:40:33.260 --> 00:40:35.000
Good morning...

00:40:35.000 --> 00:40:36.270
Toudou-san.

00:40:36.270 --> 00:40:37.890
Come with me.

00:40:37.890 --> 00:40:39.930
I will take you to some place nice.

00:40:55.830 --> 00:40:58.200
This, is my secret practice ground.

00:40:59.710 --> 00:41:02.910
Every morning, I would play against this wall.

00:41:03.750 --> 00:41:06.380
No wonder Toudousan is such a good player,

00:41:06.380 --> 00:41:07.540
every morning!

00:41:09.210 --> 00:41:10.920
I still need more...

00:41:10.920 --> 00:41:12.300
Use this one.

00:41:12.300 --> 00:41:14.340
It's mine, so it's rather heavy.

00:41:15.350 --> 00:41:19.130
I wish you'll do your best, I know you have problems.

00:41:39.450 --> 00:41:40.750
You have tense shoulders!

00:41:40.750 --> 00:41:41.660
Yes!

00:41:50.880 --> 00:41:53.380
Munakata Jin, 27 years old.

00:41:53.840 --> 00:41:55.510
96th Wimbledon,

00:41:55.510 --> 00:41:57.630
representative player of Japan.

00:41:58.470 --> 00:42:01.510
96th game, that was 6 years ago.

00:42:01.510 --> 00:42:02.270
I understand!

00:42:02.270 --> 00:42:04.140
He's a former first-class player.

00:42:04.140 --> 00:42:05.690
Wait until you hear this interesting story.

00:42:05.690 --> 00:42:07.020
He's now a coach of the Tennis Federation,

00:42:07.020 --> 00:42:09.860
and a member of the All Japan
Junior Reinforcement Committee.

00:42:09.860 --> 00:42:12.190
Member of the All Japan Junior
Reinforcement Committee?

00:42:13.030 --> 00:42:14.480
I've never heard of it.

00:42:14.820 --> 00:42:15.860
That's right.

00:42:15.860 --> 00:42:17.970
The committee was formed this year.

00:42:17.970 --> 00:42:21.200
Member of the All Japan Junior
Reinforcement Committee,

00:42:21.200 --> 00:42:22.750
Munakata Jin...

00:42:22.750 --> 00:42:26.460
Nishi is now in the center of the
Junior Tennis World of Japan.

00:42:26.460 --> 00:42:28.460
And Munakata Jin came from there.

00:42:28.460 --> 00:42:29.550
What is going to happen?

00:42:29.550 --> 00:42:32.420
No, something is happening, if not strange...

00:42:40.640 --> 00:42:41.890
Where's father?

00:42:41.890 --> 00:42:43.230
He's in the library.

00:42:43.230 --> 00:42:44.470
Thanks.

00:42:45.060 --> 00:42:46.480
Miss!

00:42:46.480 --> 00:42:48.680
He's with a visitor.

00:42:49.310 --> 00:42:52.230
A man who was here before, Munakata.

00:42:52.230 --> 00:42:54.980
I was told they are not to be disturbed.

00:42:56.070 --> 00:42:57.900
I just want to say good night.

00:43:00.580 --> 00:43:04.360
Your proposal has been approved in
the Board of Directors, Mr. Munakata.

00:43:05.580 --> 00:43:07.280
Thank you very much.

00:43:07.540 --> 00:43:08.880
As you said,

00:43:08.880 --> 00:43:12.050
for Japanese Tennis to make strides into the world,

00:43:12.050 --> 00:43:14.420
it's urgent to bring up Junior players.

00:43:14.420 --> 00:43:17.950
I've already sent an official notice
to the branches of the federation.

00:43:17.950 --> 00:43:19.140
Requested them,

00:43:19.140 --> 00:43:23.680
as soon as possible, to recommend candidates
for the All Japan Special Junior Team.

00:43:23.680 --> 00:43:26.470
All Japan Special Junior Team?!

00:43:26.770 --> 00:43:28.150
Mr. Munakata,

00:43:28.150 --> 00:43:31.810
we should start listing the names
of those in our prefecture.

00:43:32.190 --> 00:43:33.320
In our prefecture,

00:43:33.320 --> 00:43:35.940
I've already decided on two boys and three girls.

00:43:35.940 --> 00:43:36.780
Really?

00:43:36.780 --> 00:43:38.820
Could you name them, if you don't mind?

00:43:38.820 --> 00:43:41.530
The Boys, Toudou Takayuki and Ozaki Yuu.

00:43:41.530 --> 00:43:42.830
The Girls, Ryuuzaki Reika,

00:43:42.830 --> 00:43:45.000
Midorikawa Ranko of Kaga High School

00:43:45.000 --> 00:43:46.700
and Nishi's Oka Hiromi.

00:43:48.870 --> 00:43:49.750
Oka?

00:43:49.750 --> 00:43:52.410
The one playing with Reika in the double?

00:43:53.380 --> 00:43:54.630
I thought you were going to choose,

00:43:54.630 --> 00:43:56.510
the team's captain, Tagi, of Nishi High.

00:43:56.510 --> 00:43:58.710
No, it's Oka Hiromi.

00:43:59.260 --> 00:43:59.890
All right.

00:43:59.890 --> 00:44:02.550
I'll leave the whole matter up to you.

00:44:02.550 --> 00:44:05.430
Thank you very much...

00:44:22.950 --> 00:44:24.830
You see, it's raining!

00:44:24.830 --> 00:44:26.660
Practice is off for a long interval.

00:44:26.660 --> 00:44:28.750
Listen Hiromi, how about going to the movies?

00:44:28.750 --> 00:44:31.460
The revival movie of Dustin Hoffman.

00:44:31.460 --> 00:44:34.200
Can't, have to get up early in the morning.

00:44:34.200 --> 00:44:35.920
It's going to rain tomorrow.

00:44:35.920 --> 00:44:38.340
So, there's no early morning practice.

00:44:38.340 --> 00:44:41.090
Yes, you are free!

00:44:43.390 --> 00:44:45.470
Come to the court, Oka-san.

00:44:48.850 --> 00:44:49.690
Oka-san.

00:44:49.690 --> 00:44:50.760
Yes!

00:44:50.760 --> 00:44:52.230
Not only on Sunday...

00:44:52.230 --> 00:44:53.610
but also in windy and rainy days,

00:44:53.610 --> 00:44:54.980
you'll have games.

00:44:54.980 --> 00:44:56.230
Yes.

00:45:08.700 --> 00:45:09.330
Oka-san...

00:45:09.330 --> 00:45:09.830
Yes...

00:45:09.830 --> 00:45:12.830
I'm not doing this because I hate you.

00:45:15.710 --> 00:45:18.420
I first held a racket when I was seven.

00:45:19.420 --> 00:45:20.420
Since that day,

00:45:20.420 --> 00:45:22.760
I've spent most of my time playing tennis.

00:45:22.760 --> 00:45:24.260
It was tough for me.

00:45:24.260 --> 00:45:26.220
No, it's still tough for me.

00:45:26.220 --> 00:45:27.300
But...

00:45:27.300 --> 00:45:30.640
Those long hard days,
have supported me to what I'm now.

00:45:30.640 --> 00:45:34.810
So, I want to tell, not to you,
but to Munakata coach...

00:45:35.560 --> 00:45:37.190
However excellent the coach may be.

00:45:37.190 --> 00:45:39.760
Complete beginners cannot play
at the same level as me.

00:45:39.760 --> 00:45:42.610
Even if he takes special care off them.

00:45:42.610 --> 00:45:44.200
If you are growing by your own effort,

00:45:44.200 --> 00:45:45.120
however that may be.

00:45:45.120 --> 00:45:47.990
You should be ashamed of yourself
for being looked after by him.

00:45:48.830 --> 00:45:50.910
You two, what are you doing?!

00:45:54.500 --> 00:45:56.420
You shouldn't have practice today!

00:45:56.420 --> 00:45:58.290
Come inside and dry yourself!

00:46:03.130 --> 00:46:04.840
Wait, Ryuuzaki!

00:46:10.470 --> 00:46:11.350
Aikawa.

00:46:11.350 --> 00:46:12.640
Open your umbrella for Oka.

00:46:12.640 --> 00:46:13.850
Yes!

00:46:33.000 --> 00:46:34.460
If you are growing by your own effort,

00:46:34.460 --> 00:46:35.500
however that may be.

00:46:35.500 --> 00:46:38.370
You should be ashamed of yourself
for being looked after by him.

00:47:04.570 --> 00:47:06.020
Oka, right?

00:47:10.910 --> 00:47:13.290
Well, I would like to ask you one thing.

00:47:13.290 --> 00:47:15.370
Give me an answer, please.

00:47:16.210 --> 00:47:19.120
Why are you looking after me especially?

00:47:21.960 --> 00:47:24.460
I need you to reply, for the life of me!

00:47:25.760 --> 00:47:27.420
I've no need to reply.

00:47:27.760 --> 00:47:28.970
Then I...

00:47:28.970 --> 00:47:31.460
will quit from the tennis club, forever!

00:47:33.060 --> 00:47:34.550
I understand.

00:47:59.920 --> 00:48:02.200
Too noisy, you damned idiot!

00:48:05.760 --> 00:48:07.380
What did the coach say?

00:48:07.380 --> 00:48:08.710
I understand.

00:48:08.710 --> 00:48:10.500
Just those words.

00:48:10.970 --> 00:48:12.330
And so,

00:48:12.330 --> 00:48:13.800
I hung up.

00:48:13.800 --> 00:48:14.720
That's all.

00:48:14.720 --> 00:48:16.890
What will happen to the double match?

00:48:16.890 --> 00:48:17.480
As usual,

00:48:17.480 --> 00:48:20.060
she will play with Captain Tagi-san.

00:48:20.060 --> 00:48:23.510
Our tennis team will be worthy of Nishi's tradition again.

00:48:23.510 --> 00:48:24.730
That's all.

00:48:36.450 --> 00:48:39.320
Excuse me, I just need to talk with you.

00:48:40.370 --> 00:48:41.740
Oran of Kaga High!

00:48:42.000 --> 00:48:43.460
Oran of Kaga High?

00:48:43.460 --> 00:48:45.500
Hiromi, you don't know her?

00:48:45.750 --> 00:48:48.220
. Look, last year, in the National Games,

00:48:48.220 --> 00:48:52.130
Ochoufujin competed in the final
against Oran of the Bullet Service!

00:48:52.640 --> 00:48:55.390
I'm Midorikawa Ranko of Kaga High.

00:48:55.390 --> 00:48:57.350
You are, Oka Hiromi-san of Nishi,

00:48:57.350 --> 00:48:58.020
aren't you?

00:48:58.020 --> 00:49:00.680
Yes, but, how do you know me?

00:49:01.060 --> 00:49:02.600
Through Jin.

00:49:02.860 --> 00:49:03.890
Jin?

00:49:04.110 --> 00:49:06.320
In the coming doubles match,

00:49:06.320 --> 00:49:08.850
I'm supposed to play against you.

00:49:09.650 --> 00:49:10.990
I'm looking forward to it.

00:49:10.990 --> 00:49:14.900
Because I want to confirm
how well Jin has trained you.

00:49:15.120 --> 00:49:17.450
Excuse me, you are you kind of rude.

00:49:17.450 --> 00:49:20.120
Jin, Jin, he is our coach!

00:49:22.460 --> 00:49:23.330
Sorry.

00:49:23.330 --> 00:49:25.250
Munakata Jin is my brother.

00:49:25.750 --> 00:49:28.620
He's the son of the woman
my father left before.

00:49:29.340 --> 00:49:33.380
Jin is my brother.

00:49:34.050 --> 00:49:36.140
You, who wins Jin's confidence,

00:49:36.140 --> 00:49:39.380
must receive my bullet service.

00:49:39.930 --> 00:49:42.010
If you can.

00:49:47.070 --> 00:49:48.710
Midorikawa-san!

00:49:48.710 --> 00:49:49.740
Thanks for your words,

00:49:49.740 --> 00:49:52.400
but I've quit the tennis club.

00:49:54.660 --> 00:49:56.180
Are you joking?!

00:49:56.180 --> 00:49:58.240
If you behave in any way to make Jin sad,

00:49:58.240 --> 00:49:59.780
I will not forgive you!

00:50:04.000 --> 00:50:06.450
Why would the coach feel sad?

00:50:08.840 --> 00:50:10.330
Midorikawa-san!

00:50:21.980 --> 00:50:26.350
I would like to see his face sad, if I can!

00:50:27.270 --> 00:50:29.230
Have a care!

00:50:31.650 --> 00:50:32.680
One!

00:50:32.680 --> 00:50:33.450
Two!

00:50:33.450 --> 00:50:34.820
One!

00:50:34.820 --> 00:50:35.900
Two...

00:50:52.710 --> 00:50:54.790
We will be late!

00:51:07.020 --> 00:51:08.890
Are you still going to practice?

00:51:09.360 --> 00:51:10.480
Y-yes.

00:51:10.860 --> 00:51:14.480
You haven't been to the morning
practice these past few days.

00:51:15.570 --> 00:51:17.150
Don't skip practice too much.

00:51:21.740 --> 00:51:23.290
Toudou-san doesn't know yet,

00:51:23.290 --> 00:51:25.320
that I've quit the tennis team.

00:51:28.420 --> 00:51:29.790
Coach, that's the problem,

00:51:29.790 --> 00:51:32.290
you should have let it known to everybody.

00:51:33.380 --> 00:51:35.830
Look Hiromi, which do you like?

00:51:40.850 --> 00:51:43.340
Maki-chan, why don't you go to the practice?

00:51:43.600 --> 00:51:44.470
What are you saying?

00:51:44.470 --> 00:51:46.330
I'm keeping you company, Hiromi.

00:51:46.330 --> 00:51:47.770
You should go to the practice.

00:51:47.770 --> 00:51:49.480
Because you didn't quit the team.

00:51:49.480 --> 00:51:50.560
Don't sound so self-important!

00:51:50.560 --> 00:51:51.570
I'll quit too.

00:51:51.570 --> 00:51:53.730
I'll send a notice that I'm
leaving the team tomorrow.

00:51:53.730 --> 00:51:55.110
If I back-dated it, 2 or 3 days,

00:51:55.110 --> 00:51:56.860
it will be the same date as yours.

00:52:09.750 --> 00:52:10.700
Maki...

00:52:10.920 --> 00:52:13.110
Don't quit the tennis team.

00:52:13.110 --> 00:52:15.630
I quit because I have problems.

00:52:15.630 --> 00:52:17.340
Maki, don't do that, just continue.

00:52:17.340 --> 00:52:18.220
Ridiculous!

00:52:18.220 --> 00:52:21.680
Without you, the tennis team
doesn't mean anything to me.

00:52:21.680 --> 00:52:23.290
Yes, it does!

00:52:23.290 --> 00:52:25.180
If I'm not there...

00:52:26.020 --> 00:52:29.430
You can still enjoy playing tennis.

00:52:39.950 --> 00:52:40.950
Stupid!

00:52:40.950 --> 00:52:42.320
You love tennis the most,

00:52:42.320 --> 00:52:43.450
why did you quit it?!

00:52:43.450 --> 00:52:44.700
What does Ochoufujin matter...

00:52:44.700 --> 00:52:46.120
What do the others matter?!

00:52:46.120 --> 00:52:47.450
You should do it, Hiromi!

00:52:47.450 --> 00:52:49.580
Hiromi, you should continue playing tennis!

00:52:49.580 --> 00:52:50.500
Hey, sit-down!

00:52:50.500 --> 00:52:51.620
I can't see!

00:52:54.500 --> 00:52:56.260
Please tell me, you'll do it, Hiromi.

00:52:56.260 --> 00:52:57.790
Tell me you'll play again!

00:52:59.130 --> 00:53:01.500
Please! Please!

00:53:06.220 --> 00:53:07.260
Come in!

00:53:10.060 --> 00:53:11.890
It's Aikawa.

00:53:11.890 --> 00:53:15.050
I'm here, on behalf of Oka Hiromi.

00:53:15.050 --> 00:53:16.480
On behalf of?

00:53:18.030 --> 00:53:19.740
Oka has stated as follows:

00:53:19.740 --> 00:53:22.820
She's really sorry about the
telephone call the other day.

00:53:23.070 --> 00:53:25.160
She regrets it very much.

00:53:25.160 --> 00:53:26.450
If she could have a chance,

00:53:26.450 --> 00:53:27.490
with your permission,

00:53:27.490 --> 00:53:30.080
she would like to join the team again.

00:53:30.080 --> 00:53:30.960
Aikawa...

00:53:30.960 --> 00:53:31.950
Yes?

00:53:32.370 --> 00:53:35.790
I've not received any formal report
stating that she had quit.

00:53:36.000 --> 00:53:38.500
So, Oka is still a member of the team.

00:53:39.210 --> 00:53:40.580
Hiromi!

00:53:41.100 --> 00:53:44.670
Come, you're okay, come on in!

00:53:50.180 --> 00:53:50.930
Oka...

00:53:50.930 --> 00:53:52.250
Yes...

00:53:52.250 --> 00:53:54.260
How many days have you missed?

00:53:54.650 --> 00:53:55.890
Five days.

00:53:56.360 --> 00:53:57.310
Okay.

00:53:57.650 --> 00:53:59.520
It'll be tougher due to that.

00:53:59.780 --> 00:54:01.150
Yes!

00:54:17.750 --> 00:54:19.490
Ryuuzaki, come to the court!

00:54:19.490 --> 00:54:20.750
Formation A!

00:54:34.060 --> 00:54:36.890
If I continue playing tennis, anyhow...

00:54:37.230 --> 00:54:40.190
I want to become just like Ochoufujin!

00:54:47.410 --> 00:54:49.930
Along the baseline, ten more times!

00:54:49.930 --> 00:54:50.660
Yes!

00:54:50.660 --> 00:54:52.060
Ten more times!

00:54:52.060 --> 00:54:53.280
Fight!

00:55:45.010 --> 00:55:47.670
I can't hit such a terrific service.

00:55:48.220 --> 00:55:50.300
30 - 15

00:56:17.750 --> 00:56:19.660
40 - 15

00:56:22.840 --> 00:56:24.040
Oka-san,

00:56:24.460 --> 00:56:26.210
don't interfere with my game.

00:56:44.530 --> 00:56:45.150
Game!

00:56:45.150 --> 00:56:46.570
End first set!

00:56:46.570 --> 00:56:47.740
Midorikawa!

00:56:47.740 --> 00:56:49.810
Six games to three!

00:56:51.950 --> 00:56:52.940
Ryuuzaki!

00:56:53.580 --> 00:56:55.740
Are you playing alone in the double?

00:56:55.740 --> 00:56:57.450
You are hitting the balls for Oka,

00:56:57.450 --> 00:56:58.700
undoubtedly!

00:56:58.700 --> 00:57:00.170
You don't like it?

00:57:00.170 --> 00:57:03.110
I intended to do the best I can.

00:57:03.110 --> 00:57:04.710
You didn't even let your partner hit the ball,

00:57:04.710 --> 00:57:05.750
what is your best then?

00:57:05.750 --> 00:57:06.670
This game,

00:57:06.670 --> 00:57:08.670
we were meant to lose from the start.

00:57:09.260 --> 00:57:10.510
If the game is to be lost,

00:57:10.510 --> 00:57:12.420
I want to lose it, out of my own fault.

00:57:15.930 --> 00:57:17.010
Oka!

00:57:18.430 --> 00:57:20.620
You can leave the worries to Ryuuzaki.

00:57:20.620 --> 00:57:23.100
You've other things to do than that!

00:57:23.980 --> 00:57:25.820
Just one ball...

00:57:25.820 --> 00:57:27.730
In the next service, only one ball...

00:57:27.730 --> 00:57:30.690
Show me that you can return
the service of Midorikawa.

00:57:32.200 --> 00:57:33.030
If Ryuuzaki can,

00:57:33.030 --> 00:57:34.860
there's no reason you can't!

00:58:03.440 --> 00:58:05.180
Just one ball!

00:58:06.360 --> 00:58:09.060
She made it again, bullet service!

00:58:38.430 --> 00:58:40.220
Hiromi, fight!

00:58:55.030 --> 00:58:57.450
She did it! Hiromi got an Ace!

00:58:57.450 --> 00:58:59.440
She broke the Bullet Service!

00:59:20.140 --> 00:59:21.800
She received it again!

00:59:34.610 --> 00:59:36.700
Next game we'll take Formation A,

00:59:36.700 --> 00:59:38.030
We will go on to win!

00:59:38.030 --> 00:59:39.570
You can do it, Hiro!

00:59:42.790 --> 00:59:43.820
Yes!

01:00:06.940 --> 01:00:08.270
You did it Hiromi!

01:00:08.270 --> 01:00:09.270
You've won against Midorikawa,

01:00:09.270 --> 01:00:10.730
even though defeat seemed certain!

01:00:10.730 --> 01:00:13.320
Because you broke the bullet service!

01:00:13.320 --> 01:00:15.110
Ochoufujin also, since then,

01:00:15.110 --> 01:00:16.700
has regained her form.

01:00:16.700 --> 01:00:17.570
To tell you the truth,

01:00:17.570 --> 01:00:19.240
I have always recognized your true ability,

01:00:19.240 --> 01:00:20.320
That's the truth!!

01:00:20.320 --> 01:00:22.080
How cheeky, to say such a thing, Maki.

01:00:22.080 --> 01:00:23.740
It could be another of your jests.

01:00:23.740 --> 01:00:25.540
Oh, why?!

01:00:25.540 --> 01:00:28.960
It was by chance,
it was just pure luck.

01:00:28.960 --> 01:00:30.960
I was just lucky.

01:00:30.960 --> 01:00:32.590
No, it wasn't!

01:00:32.590 --> 01:00:33.710
I have evidence for that.

01:00:33.710 --> 01:00:35.010
It was while I was desperate,

01:00:35.010 --> 01:00:36.470
that a song came into my head,

01:00:36.470 --> 01:00:39.040
and as I played, it stayed in my head.

01:00:56.400 --> 01:00:59.440
What's the song? Is it new?

01:00:59.440 --> 01:01:01.530
Yep! Maybe new...

01:01:01.530 --> 01:01:04.570
because I made it up without
thinking during that match.

01:01:08.620 --> 01:01:10.030
Oka-kun, pass!

01:01:12.250 --> 01:01:13.410
Nice catch!

01:01:14.130 --> 01:01:16.370
Oka-kun, I was looking for you.

01:01:21.220 --> 01:01:23.920
I will present this to you...

01:01:26.970 --> 01:01:29.010
The match against Midorikawa.

01:01:32.860 --> 01:01:34.350
I think it'll be of use to you.

01:01:35.360 --> 01:01:37.440
For me, so thoughtful?

01:01:37.440 --> 01:01:40.270
No, Oka-kun, no need to thank him for that.

01:01:40.740 --> 01:01:43.770
He did take the the pictures,

01:01:43.770 --> 01:01:46.400
but the idea was brought up by him.

01:01:47.910 --> 01:01:48.950
Hey, Ozaki!

01:01:48.950 --> 01:01:50.870
You'd promised not to blow it wide open.

01:01:57.000 --> 01:01:59.080
Thank you very much.

01:01:59.630 --> 01:02:00.840
N-no, it's...

01:02:00.840 --> 01:02:01.930
Shall we go, Toudou?

01:02:01.930 --> 01:02:03.050
Lunch-break is over!

01:02:03.050 --> 01:02:04.090
O-Okay...

01:02:05.640 --> 01:02:06.720
See you!

01:02:08.020 --> 01:02:09.630
Ball! Ball!

01:02:24.410 --> 01:02:26.780
Dear Aikawa Maki-dono,

01:02:26.990 --> 01:02:29.200
How is your summer vacation?

01:02:29.200 --> 01:02:30.540
I'm in the highlands,

01:02:30.540 --> 01:02:33.120
with refreshing winds and lots of greenery,

01:02:33.120 --> 01:02:35.620
totally immersed in playing tennis.

01:02:38.090 --> 01:02:41.420
Two weeks have already passed since I joined the camp.

01:02:41.970 --> 01:02:42.880
But as you know,

01:02:42.880 --> 01:02:45.740
this is not like the usual camping trips.

01:02:45.740 --> 01:02:47.760
From all over Japan,

01:02:47.760 --> 01:02:50.970
about 80 selected junior players gathered.

01:02:50.970 --> 01:02:52.560
And among them,

01:02:52.560 --> 01:02:56.060
some will be selected as members of the first All Japan Junior Special Team.

01:02:56.060 --> 01:02:58.150
So this is a very serious camping trip.

01:02:58.150 --> 01:02:59.730
Powerful players from all over Japan,

01:02:59.730 --> 01:03:01.990
hoping to be selected for the Team.

01:03:01.990 --> 01:03:03.990
And all are trying very hard.

01:03:03.990 --> 01:03:05.660
So they're not in the mood to feel free,

01:03:05.660 --> 01:03:09.030
nor have the time to be fascinated with the beautiful lake and forest sceneries.

01:03:09.030 --> 01:03:13.080
The Special team is selected by having
each of us compete against the other,

01:03:13.080 --> 01:03:15.210
by drawing lots and play ten matches.

01:03:15.210 --> 01:03:18.750
They're later chosen according to
their results from those matches.

01:03:18.750 --> 01:03:20.090
So Aikawa-kun,

01:03:20.090 --> 01:03:21.710
I have special trainings daily.

01:03:21.710 --> 01:03:23.840
And once, a two-days match!

01:03:23.840 --> 01:03:26.210
Goodness, goodness, goodness!

01:03:26.680 --> 01:03:29.380
Why should I have such a hard time?

01:03:29.380 --> 01:03:31.090
Damn!

01:03:31.770 --> 01:03:33.430
It can't be helped...

01:03:33.430 --> 01:03:36.600
Coach's forcible ways is nothing new to us!

01:03:36.690 --> 01:03:37.710
Anyway,

01:03:37.710 --> 01:03:42.150
I've completed five matches so far,
three wins and two losses.

01:03:42.150 --> 01:03:43.190
Ok, see you.

01:03:44.360 --> 01:03:45.400
P.S.

01:03:45.820 --> 01:03:47.990
But at least it's some consolation that...

01:03:47.990 --> 01:03:49.700
I'm with Ochoufujin, Midorikawa-san,

01:03:49.700 --> 01:03:52.400
Ozaki-san and Toudou-san.

01:04:15.140 --> 01:04:16.690
Hey, look Toudou.

01:04:16.690 --> 01:04:18.350
That racket of Oka-kun...

01:04:19.190 --> 01:04:21.350
It has lead on it's frame.

01:04:22.070 --> 01:04:23.440
And early every morning...

01:04:23.440 --> 01:04:25.980
she runs along the lakeside dragging a car tire.

01:04:26.320 --> 01:04:28.570
All the other players saw her doing that.

01:04:29.110 --> 01:04:30.120
And now...

01:04:30.120 --> 01:04:33.150
there are talks that such methods are too hard for girls.

01:04:34.120 --> 01:04:37.450
He's going too far, Munakata coach...

01:04:52.220 --> 01:04:53.800
To have vomited,

01:04:55.890 --> 01:04:58.520
is it necessary to go so far as to vomiting?

01:04:58.520 --> 01:05:01.060
Even the male players would give out.

01:05:01.060 --> 01:05:03.520
Did Oka ask you to say that?

01:05:03.520 --> 01:05:04.820
N-no...

01:05:04.820 --> 01:05:06.720
Then it's not necessary.

01:05:06.720 --> 01:05:07.650
If she doesn't give up,

01:05:07.650 --> 01:05:09.520
nobody has the right to put in a word.

01:05:10.490 --> 01:05:11.440
Yes...

01:05:12.320 --> 01:05:14.280
Girls don't have power, by nature...

01:05:14.280 --> 01:05:16.990
so they require more training than boys.

01:05:17.830 --> 01:05:19.870
Oka is the material that I have chosen.

01:05:19.870 --> 01:05:21.580
I can refer to her as an
experimental material.

01:05:24.040 --> 01:05:26.090
For the players who are
competing at world level,

01:05:26.090 --> 01:05:27.710
having skill is not enough...

01:05:27.710 --> 01:05:29.170
They need power!

01:05:29.420 --> 01:05:30.800
Japanese girl players,

01:05:30.800 --> 01:05:32.430
have to enter the age of power tennis.

01:05:32.430 --> 01:05:33.510
Just as the boys.

01:05:34.100 --> 01:05:36.590
Oka should go beyond being a mere woman!

01:05:57.620 --> 01:05:58.790
A leg cramp.

01:05:58.790 --> 01:05:59.450
Don't worry,

01:05:59.450 --> 01:06:01.370
after a massage it will feel better.

01:06:01.580 --> 01:06:02.920
Everyone go ahead!

01:06:02.920 --> 01:06:05.200
I'll take her back once she can walk.

01:06:12.010 --> 01:06:13.590
Does it still hurt?

01:06:13.590 --> 01:06:15.050
Yes, a little...

01:06:16.970 --> 01:06:18.100
It's all right,

01:06:18.100 --> 01:06:19.060
they will pick us up soon,

01:06:19.060 --> 01:06:20.680
when they've returned to the lodging.

01:06:20.680 --> 01:06:22.760
I'm so sorry, because I was...

01:06:22.980 --> 01:06:23.940
Don't worry about that.

01:06:23.940 --> 01:06:26.350
You must be exhausted.

01:06:29.320 --> 01:06:31.520
Do you feel cold? You're shaking.

01:07:00.560 --> 01:07:02.260
Oka-kun, look at this.

01:07:02.980 --> 01:07:06.510
I got it the first time I won
the National Championship.

01:07:08.230 --> 01:07:10.350
I want you to keep it...

01:07:24.160 --> 01:07:25.910
Thank you very much.

01:07:32.970 --> 01:07:36.470
I have ruined this afternoon's
training schedule.

01:07:36.470 --> 01:07:37.720
I'm sorry.

01:07:37.720 --> 01:07:39.300
There's no need to apologize.

01:07:39.300 --> 01:07:42.130
You didn't do anything to be apologized for.

01:07:43.310 --> 01:07:45.390
Hurry inside and warm yourself up.

01:07:56.820 --> 01:07:58.440
He gave it to you?

01:07:58.440 --> 01:08:00.900
It was a gift, from Toudou-san.

01:08:03.660 --> 01:08:05.700
I will keep it for you.

01:08:06.250 --> 01:08:07.450
All right?

01:08:19.090 --> 01:08:20.630
How was your camping trip?

01:08:21.760 --> 01:08:23.350
Not too bad.

01:08:23.350 --> 01:08:25.540
How was your record from the matches?

01:08:25.540 --> 01:08:27.100
Six wins and four losses.

01:08:27.100 --> 01:08:28.850
You have more wins than losses!

01:08:28.850 --> 01:08:30.810
Yes, very good fights.

01:08:30.810 --> 01:08:34.230
Do you think you'll be in the
All Japan Special Junior Team?

01:08:34.230 --> 01:08:35.300
Not yet.

01:08:35.300 --> 01:08:37.630
The selection meeting is to beheld by now.

01:08:37.630 --> 01:08:39.360
But I'm afraid I won't be selected.

01:08:39.360 --> 01:08:42.990
The number of those that won all the games
are less than those that won 9 or 8 games.

01:08:44.160 --> 01:08:45.530
I'm home!

01:08:58.340 --> 01:09:00.420
Are you disappointed?

01:09:01.390 --> 01:09:02.680
Not really.

01:09:02.680 --> 01:09:03.350
Really?

01:09:03.350 --> 01:09:04.390
Really!

01:09:04.390 --> 01:09:05.140
At all?

01:09:05.140 --> 01:09:05.970
At all!

01:09:05.970 --> 01:09:07.480
Ok, good good!

01:09:07.480 --> 01:09:10.150
Then I'll see you when school starts, okay?

01:09:10.150 --> 01:09:11.390
Ok ok!

01:09:19.110 --> 01:09:20.910
For the All Japan Junior Special Team,

01:09:20.910 --> 01:09:22.950
boys' players, Toudou Takayuki, Ozaki Yuu,

01:09:22.950 --> 01:09:25.150
Suzuki Hisashi, Nishiyama Hajime,

01:09:25.150 --> 01:09:26.830
Higashi Shyouji, Matsumura Saburou,

01:09:26.830 --> 01:09:28.330
Ooishi Makoto, Umeda Jun.

01:09:28.330 --> 01:09:30.530
We have selected the above eight.

01:09:31.040 --> 01:09:33.170
Now, the issue for the girls'...

01:09:33.170 --> 01:09:35.360
Everyone read the list given to you.

01:09:35.360 --> 01:09:36.550
Complete victory, Ryuuzaki,

01:09:36.550 --> 01:09:37.970
Midorikawa with nine wins,

01:09:37.970 --> 01:09:39.590
and five players with eight wins.

01:09:39.590 --> 01:09:40.800
For the above seven players,

01:09:40.800 --> 01:09:43.340
I understand that none of you will disagree.

01:09:43.340 --> 01:09:45.930
But no one follows those seven...

01:09:45.930 --> 01:09:49.760
For there are ten players
with six wins and four losses.

01:09:49.760 --> 01:09:50.560
In our original plan,

01:09:50.560 --> 01:09:53.440
we've decided that there'll be eight members
for both boys and girls team.

01:09:53.440 --> 01:09:56.480
And we would let them enter
the World Junior Championship,

01:09:56.480 --> 01:09:58.520
held in America, this year.

01:09:58.900 --> 01:10:00.360
However, in reference to the girls,

01:10:00.360 --> 01:10:02.240
we would like to select seven players this time.

01:10:02.240 --> 01:10:04.400
I'd like to hear opinions, before we proceed.

01:10:06.030 --> 01:10:07.450
I think that's appropriate.

01:10:07.450 --> 01:10:08.500
How about rematches,

01:10:08.500 --> 01:10:11.200
among those ten players
with six wins, four losses?

01:10:11.420 --> 01:10:13.460
Well, we have considered that,

01:10:13.460 --> 01:10:14.330
but within this week,

01:10:14.330 --> 01:10:17.500
the entrance notice must be submitted
to the headquarters, in America.

01:10:17.500 --> 01:10:20.260
Also, the players have already
dispersed to their own areas,

01:10:20.260 --> 01:10:21.510
and started school by now.

01:10:21.510 --> 01:10:23.090
It's absolutely impossible.

01:10:23.430 --> 01:10:25.180
As for the eighth player,

01:10:25.180 --> 01:10:27.300
I recommend Oka Hiromi.

01:10:32.640 --> 01:10:36.510
Because Oka is the only first grade
student among the 'six wins' players.

01:10:36.510 --> 01:10:37.440
And one more point...

01:10:37.440 --> 01:10:40.110
it's been barely six months since
she started playing tennis.

01:10:40.110 --> 01:10:42.560
Yet she's able to progress that well.

01:10:42.560 --> 01:10:44.280
I think this is worth mentioning,

01:10:44.280 --> 01:10:46.060
among all the participants.

01:10:46.060 --> 01:10:50.700
If this committee puts its subject matter
in the development of Japanese Tennis,

01:10:50.700 --> 01:10:53.870
I believe that we should appreciate the prospects of Oka.

01:10:54.880 --> 01:10:57.660
I agree on that opinion with Mr. Munakata.

01:10:58.920 --> 01:11:00.630
As far as her prospects go,

01:11:00.630 --> 01:11:02.670
Oka-san has as much to be appreciated,

01:11:02.670 --> 01:11:04.220
as my daughter, Reika.

01:11:04.220 --> 01:11:05.830
I, too, recommend her.

01:11:05.830 --> 01:11:07.800
Please wait, Chairman!

01:11:08.060 --> 01:11:09.140
Munakata-san...

01:11:09.140 --> 01:11:11.680
Oka, is she not the player you've trained?

01:11:11.680 --> 01:11:13.350
This is why it's not fair.

01:11:13.350 --> 01:11:14.770
Are you not ashamed of this?

01:11:14.770 --> 01:11:15.940
If I have confidence in the players,

01:11:15.940 --> 01:11:16.980
whom, I myself trained...

01:11:16.980 --> 01:11:18.640
why should I be ashamed?

01:11:20.070 --> 01:11:22.950
In short, I want you to show us not something vague,

01:11:22.950 --> 01:11:26.070
such as prospects, but something clear.

01:11:31.620 --> 01:11:33.660
Oka-san of the 1st Grade, Class B,

01:11:33.660 --> 01:11:35.790
come to the office of coach Munakata,

01:11:35.790 --> 01:11:36.870
immediately.

01:11:37.170 --> 01:11:39.450
Oka-san of the 1st Grade, Class B...

01:11:40.800 --> 01:11:42.090
Tomorrow, after school,

01:11:42.090 --> 01:11:44.400
you are to play on the Nishi tennis court.

01:11:44.400 --> 01:11:45.930
The Chairman of the Tennis Committee,

01:11:45.930 --> 01:11:47.670
and its members will be present.

01:11:48.550 --> 01:11:50.340
If you win, you'll become a member.

01:11:51.270 --> 01:11:53.050
Against Ryuuzaki Reika,

01:11:53.350 --> 01:11:54.720
you're sure to win!

01:11:55.520 --> 01:11:57.640
I'm absolutely not...

01:11:58.190 --> 01:11:59.060
Sooner or later,

01:11:59.060 --> 01:12:01.100
you're to come up against her.

01:12:01.730 --> 01:12:03.030
I am sure not to win!

01:12:03.030 --> 01:12:04.270
Cross my heart!

01:12:13.790 --> 01:12:15.860
I've been doing some hard thinking,

01:12:15.860 --> 01:12:17.420
Even in the severe special training,

01:12:17.420 --> 01:12:19.200
I've intended to do my very best.

01:12:19.540 --> 01:12:21.020
Once, I did so much...

01:12:21.020 --> 01:12:23.040
wanted to be selected for that team!

01:12:23.040 --> 01:12:24.210
To tell you the truth,

01:12:24.210 --> 01:12:25.710
I still have such a feeling.

01:12:26.180 --> 01:12:27.990
But that's different...

01:12:27.990 --> 01:12:31.590
It's not as such that I want
to fight against Ochoufujin.

01:12:32.850 --> 01:12:34.540
Even then,

01:12:34.540 --> 01:12:37.010
I have to be at the court, tomorrow.

01:12:38.020 --> 01:12:39.100
Coach...

01:12:39.400 --> 01:12:41.860
since I started playing tennis...

01:12:41.860 --> 01:12:44.570
No, since you've appeared,

01:12:44.570 --> 01:12:46.940
I've been changing into such a bad girl.

01:12:47.570 --> 01:12:49.280
Everything I'm thinking of,

01:12:49.280 --> 01:12:51.150
evolves around tennis.

01:12:51.740 --> 01:12:52.870
I'm afraid that...

01:12:52.870 --> 01:12:55.610
I'll forget something more important.

01:13:06.670 --> 01:13:08.000
It's time to tell him!

01:13:08.340 --> 01:13:10.710
Now, it is time to quit tennis!

01:13:28.700 --> 01:13:29.900
Oka is it.

01:13:35.160 --> 01:13:36.160
I remember now,

01:13:36.160 --> 01:13:37.700
the same thing happened before.

01:13:37.700 --> 01:13:39.620
I didn't say a word.

01:13:39.620 --> 01:13:41.450
Yet, how did you know it's me?

01:13:46.000 --> 01:13:48.200
Because the thing I think of...

01:13:48.200 --> 01:13:50.380
is always about you.

01:13:58.930 --> 01:14:00.100
What's the matter?

01:14:00.810 --> 01:14:01.850
Can't you sleep?

01:14:01.850 --> 01:14:03.100
N-no...

01:14:04.650 --> 01:14:06.060
So what did you want?

01:14:11.320 --> 01:14:12.700
In tomorrow's match,

01:14:12.700 --> 01:14:14.470
I will do my best.

01:14:14.470 --> 01:14:15.950
I'll get an ace from Ochoufujin.

01:14:15.950 --> 01:14:17.740
Only one is enough for me!

01:14:29.340 --> 01:14:30.970
Oka, Ryuuzaki!

01:14:30.970 --> 01:14:33.510
Best of three set match.

01:14:33.510 --> 01:14:35.260
Service Oka!

01:14:35.260 --> 01:14:36.260
Play!

01:15:28.070 --> 01:15:31.140
Hiromi, that was a splendid ace!

01:15:31.490 --> 01:15:33.610
You've advanced so
much to be at this level!

01:15:34.070 --> 01:15:35.900
In this match,

01:15:36.160 --> 01:15:38.230
I won't lose a game to you,

01:15:39.950 --> 01:15:42.070
as far as you're following me,

01:15:42.070 --> 01:15:44.410
that's my way of showing my love for you!

01:15:45.170 --> 01:15:47.380
So come on, Hiromi!

01:15:47.380 --> 01:15:48.700
With all your strength!

01:16:37.970 --> 01:16:38.680
Game!

01:16:38.680 --> 01:16:40.800
End First Set, Ryuuzaki!

01:16:40.800 --> 01:16:42.920
Six games to three.

01:16:44.640 --> 01:16:46.940
She was too good for losing this set.

01:16:46.940 --> 01:16:48.760
She is going to recover.

01:16:48.760 --> 01:16:49.980
For, me, it's the first time...

01:16:49.980 --> 01:16:51.610
to see the queen of the junior tennis world,

01:16:51.610 --> 01:16:54.520
Ryuuzaki Reika, playing for her life!

01:17:09.630 --> 01:17:10.650
Out!

01:17:10.650 --> 01:17:12.250
15 to love!

01:17:15.300 --> 01:17:16.960
That's amazing!

01:17:19.050 --> 01:17:20.680
Now, it's time to tell me the reason...

01:17:20.680 --> 01:17:22.920
why you've chosen Oka-san.

01:17:26.310 --> 01:17:27.300
Oka was...

01:17:29.600 --> 01:17:31.770
Oka was, among the freshman players,

01:17:33.070 --> 01:17:35.350
with the form the easiest to handle,

01:17:36.490 --> 01:17:37.730
has good spring,

01:17:38.110 --> 01:17:39.910
and much power.

01:17:39.910 --> 01:17:41.650
Is that all?

01:17:42.570 --> 01:17:43.410
No...

01:17:43.410 --> 01:17:47.160
and somehow, Oka is the very image of my mother.

01:17:49.120 --> 01:17:51.520
My mother, the woman who was left...

01:17:51.520 --> 01:17:54.450
by the man she loved and ended
her life failing to escape the sorrow.

01:17:54.880 --> 01:17:56.160
She's that sort of woman...

01:17:57.510 --> 01:18:00.090
He, who left Jin's mother is my father.

01:18:00.090 --> 01:18:00.970
Ever since I was eight years old,

01:18:00.970 --> 01:18:03.300
my mother and I had lived alone.

01:18:04.850 --> 01:18:06.510
But in my memory...

01:18:06.890 --> 01:18:10.220
I only see her sobbing alone.

01:18:10.940 --> 01:18:13.270
I don't even remember her smile.

01:18:14.310 --> 01:18:15.940
That's my mother...

01:18:15.940 --> 01:18:17.810
Somehow, Oka is the image of her.

01:18:18.030 --> 01:18:18.990
One fainthearted woman,

01:18:18.990 --> 01:18:21.110
like my mother, is enough in this world.

01:18:21.950 --> 01:18:22.860
So...

01:18:23.320 --> 01:18:25.400
I wanted to make Oka a strong player,

01:18:25.700 --> 01:18:27.600
a strong player in her mind!

01:18:27.600 --> 01:18:29.030
By my hand!

01:18:35.090 --> 01:18:38.830
Even if I have to use up all of my time!

01:18:48.600 --> 01:18:49.550
Game!

01:18:49.550 --> 01:18:52.260
End Second Set, Oka!

01:18:52.520 --> 01:18:54.470
Six games to four.

01:18:54.730 --> 01:18:57.270
Set count, one more!

01:18:59.940 --> 01:19:00.900
She did it!

01:19:00.900 --> 01:19:02.980
Hiromi got the second set!

01:19:54.410 --> 01:19:55.410
Deuce!

01:19:57.840 --> 01:19:58.830
Deuce!

01:20:01.960 --> 01:20:03.250
Deuce!

01:20:14.100 --> 01:20:16.100
Advantage, Oka!

01:20:26.570 --> 01:20:27.530
A tight corner!

01:20:27.530 --> 01:20:29.490
She's putting Ochoufujin into a corner!

01:20:29.490 --> 01:20:31.610
Hiromi, one more point to win!

01:20:52.220 --> 01:20:53.630
Game Set!

01:20:53.630 --> 01:20:56.300
End match won by Oka!

01:20:56.300 --> 01:20:57.350
Scores...

01:20:57.350 --> 01:20:58.810
Three games to six,

01:20:58.810 --> 01:21:00.480
six games to four,

01:21:00.480 --> 01:21:02.600
seven games to five!

01:21:09.200 --> 01:21:10.570
Nice fight!

01:21:11.740 --> 01:21:13.530
Thank you very much!

01:21:46.110 --> 01:21:47.770
Jin, are you happy?

01:21:48.030 --> 01:21:49.650
Don't ask me stupid things.

01:21:50.280 --> 01:21:51.980
It's written all over your face!

01:21:53.660 --> 01:21:54.950
Everything has just begun.

01:21:54.950 --> 01:21:57.610
It's merely a passing of the first mountain.

01:22:05.210 --> 01:22:06.120
Jin!

01:22:07.090 --> 01:22:07.830
Jin!

01:22:08.090 --> 01:22:09.000
Jin!

01:22:09.380 --> 01:22:10.420
Jin!

01:22:14.930 --> 01:22:16.840
Marrow Leukaemia.

01:22:17.310 --> 01:22:19.640
It isn't something that
just happened yesterday.

01:22:19.640 --> 01:22:20.430
Yes...

01:22:20.640 --> 01:22:21.810
Six years ago he collapsed,

01:22:21.810 --> 01:22:23.680
while he was playing an important match.

01:22:24.690 --> 01:22:26.890
It's a wonder that he lasted until now.

01:22:32.360 --> 01:22:33.200
What's up?

01:22:33.200 --> 01:22:35.150
You guys are not usually this meek, aren't you?

01:22:35.370 --> 01:22:36.740
This flower...

01:22:37.830 --> 01:22:39.070
Sweet smell.

01:22:39.580 --> 01:22:40.940
- Oka
- Yes.

01:22:40.940 --> 01:22:42.500
You're leaving tomorrow, at last.

01:22:42.500 --> 01:22:44.670
Coach, are you really coming there later?

01:22:44.670 --> 01:22:45.380
Of course!

01:22:45.380 --> 01:22:47.790
I can't stand having you play too freely.

01:22:48.630 --> 01:22:49.920
When the fever leaves,

01:22:49.920 --> 01:22:51.550
I'll get the doctor's permission.

01:22:51.550 --> 01:22:53.010
- Right, Ranko?
- Yes...

01:22:53.010 --> 01:22:54.430
He exaggerated,

01:22:54.430 --> 01:22:55.600
it's merely a cold.

01:22:55.600 --> 01:22:56.390
He is okay!

01:22:56.390 --> 01:22:58.100
I've decided to go there later,

01:22:58.100 --> 01:22:59.310
together with Jin.

01:22:59.310 --> 01:23:00.430
Ryuuzaki.

01:23:01.020 --> 01:23:01.600
Yes.

01:23:01.600 --> 01:23:03.310
Toudou, Ozaki...

01:23:03.310 --> 01:23:04.270
Yes, yes.

01:23:04.270 --> 01:23:05.520
and Oka.

01:23:05.730 --> 01:23:06.680
Yes.

01:23:07.110 --> 01:23:09.650
The future of the Tennis World
rests upon your shoulders.

01:23:09.650 --> 01:23:11.360
You shall learn that technique and power...

01:23:11.360 --> 01:23:13.770
of the world is more than victory and defeat.

01:23:13.770 --> 01:23:14.980
Yes!

01:23:16.280 --> 01:23:17.940
This smells really good.

01:23:18.410 --> 01:23:20.320
Thank you, Oka.

01:23:31.470 --> 01:23:33.120
Ranko...

01:23:33.120 --> 01:23:33.880
Yes.

01:23:34.090 --> 01:23:35.840
I'm sorry but can you call back,

01:23:35.840 --> 01:23:37.210
Toudou only?

01:23:38.890 --> 01:23:39.880
Yes.

01:23:52.150 --> 01:23:54.070
Someday...

01:23:54.070 --> 01:23:56.650
when Oka needs support in her mind,

01:23:57.320 --> 01:23:59.110
give it to her again.

01:24:00.930 --> 01:24:03.460
Coach, you found Oka-kun,

01:24:03.460 --> 01:24:05.200
and you trained her...

01:24:05.670 --> 01:24:07.330
so that's what you should do.

01:24:08.420 --> 01:24:10.000
I'll leave all of Oka to you!

01:24:18.010 --> 01:24:20.100
No, what on earth, Coach?!

01:24:20.100 --> 01:24:21.420
No, you must not ask...

01:24:21.890 --> 01:24:23.220
me anything!

01:24:24.350 --> 01:24:25.970
Do me the last favour...

01:24:44.370 --> 01:24:45.490
Ranko,

01:24:45.830 --> 01:24:46.780
Yes.

01:24:47.170 --> 01:24:49.370
Change the water for the flowers, please.

01:24:49.880 --> 01:24:50.870
Ok.

01:25:08.310 --> 01:25:09.970
What's the matter, Toudou?

01:25:10.480 --> 01:25:11.430
Nothing...

01:25:26.790 --> 01:25:28.740
The telephone, mother...

01:25:28.960 --> 01:25:31.660
Oka is calling me again...

01:25:50.620 --> 01:25:55.580
Oka, aim for the best!!

01:26:35.320 --> 01:26:39.900
There is no one in the court.

01:26:35.320 --> 01:26:39.900
Dare mo inai court de

01:26:40.820 --> 01:26:45.850
I cried there...

01:26:40.820 --> 01:26:45.850
Watashi wa naita

01:26:45.850 --> 01:26:48.540
The wind blows,

01:26:45.850 --> 01:26:48.540
Kaze ga wataru

01:26:48.540 --> 01:26:51.240
In the court.

01:26:48.540 --> 01:26:51.240
court de

01:26:51.240 --> 01:26:56.410
Thinking of you...

01:26:51.240 --> 01:26:56.410
Anata wo omotte

01:26:56.920 --> 01:26:59.380
Stumbling,

01:26:56.920 --> 01:26:59.380
Tsumazuite

01:26:59.380 --> 01:27:02.050
looking back...

01:26:59.380 --> 01:27:02.050
furimuite

01:27:02.050 --> 01:27:03.590
Faraway.

01:27:02.050 --> 01:27:03.590
Hurukana

01:27:03.590 --> 01:27:07.670
in search of a dream.

01:27:03.590 --> 01:27:07.670
yume wo sagasutoki

01:27:08.180 --> 01:27:13.390
Ah, farewell to those tears.

01:27:08.180 --> 01:27:13.390
Aa namidayo sayonara

01:27:13.650 --> 01:27:18.970
Ah, how wonderful youth is.

01:27:13.650 --> 01:27:18.970
Aa wakaitte subarashii

01:27:18.970 --> 01:27:21.650
And I,

01:27:18.970 --> 01:27:21.650
Watashi niwa

01:27:21.650 --> 01:27:24.730
and I,

01:27:21.650 --> 01:27:24.730
watashi niwa

01:27:25.030 --> 01:27:31.570
will always have tomorrow.

01:27:25.030 --> 01:27:31.570
ashita ga aru

01:28:01.860 --> 01:28:03.200
I've selected you,

01:28:03.200 --> 01:28:04.310
Oka!

01:28:04.310 --> 01:28:05.980
You must overcome being a mere woman!

01:28:24.170 --> 01:28:25.760
Now that you're selected, you fight!

01:28:25.760 --> 01:28:27.140
Now that you're selected you run!

01:28:27.140 --> 01:28:29.130
You have no time to cry!

01:28:42.320 --> 01:28:44.150
Coach, it's impossible!

01:28:44.150 --> 01:28:46.110
It's impossible for me to
double with Ochoufujin!

01:28:46.110 --> 01:28:47.320
Coach, impossible!

01:28:47.320 --> 01:28:49.230
There's so much difference in our abilities.

01:29:06.050 --> 01:29:08.750
Oka-kun, use my racket.

01:29:19.060 --> 01:29:21.640
Hiromi, I want to get ace!
